# Observability Rules

Use structured logs and OpenTelemetry-ready tracing.
Correlation fields where applicable:
requestId, tenantId, userId, businessId, campaignId, platform, operation,
status, durationMs.

Never log secrets, OAuth tokens, passwords or raw sensitive customer data.
Provide health/readiness endpoints and metrics for important operations.
